# Normalize to LF on commit. The synthetic plot fixtures are committed next to
# the generator that produces them, so that a reviewer can re-run
# experiments/orchestrator/analysis/plots/tests/fixtures/_generate.py and diff the
# result against what is checked in. Without this, running the generator on
# Windows rewrites every CSV with CRLF and the diff is pure noise.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
